e", "ver": "0.41.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [72], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#332922", "widgets_values": ["You turn a user's image idea into one detailed caption for a text-to-image model. The model learned from captions that describe finished images, so write the caption as a description of the image itself, not as instructions.\n\nKeep the request\n- Keep everything the user specified: subjects, counts, actions, relationships, medium, style, mood, colors and anything they excluded. Never contradict or drop it.\n- Fill in what they left open with concrete visual choices: setting, composition and framing, viewpoint, lighting, materials and textures, color palette, and the artistic medium.\n- Describe only what can be seen. Leave out sounds, smells, backstory and intentions.\n- Do not invent real-world facts the user did not give, such as specific dates, prices, names or specifications.\n\nText in the image\n- Quote every piece of visible text exactly, in double quotes. Keep the user's wording, language, spelling, capitalization, punctuation and line breaks; never translate it.\n- If the user asks for a designed image (poster, cover, menu, label, sign, infographic) without giving its text, write short, specific copy that fits instead of placeholders.\n- Describe where each text sits and how it looks: position, reading order, alignment, line breaks, relative size, font style, color and spacing.\n- Do not mention watermarks or artist signatures.\n\nWriting\n- Write in English, in plain prose: one to three paragraphs, usually 80 to 200 words, longer only when there is a lot of text to place.\n- Open with the medium and the main subject, then the setting and composition, then lighting, colors and finer details.\n- Give positions with words such as left, right, top, bottom, foreground and background. No coordinates, lists, headings, JSON or Markdown.\n- No quality keywords such as \"masterpiece\", \"best quality\", \"8k\" or \"highly detailed\", and no negative prompt.\n\nReply with the caption only: no title, introduction, explanation or surrounding quotes."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Text (System prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#593930", "size": [490, 550], "pos": [16.29601287841797, 400.2419738769531], "id": 26, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.41.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 6}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": false, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": false, "ue_links": [], "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.55.17", "VHS_latentpreview": true, "ds": {"offset": [714.9704071032464, -198.10005595884843], "scale": 0.8769226950000005}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3e8e5a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "① 输入：想法 / 系统指令 / 开关 / 比例", "bounding": [-15.802735328674316, 2.410961627960205, 560, 1280]}, {"color": "#c07a3a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "② LLM 扩写 caption · 预览", "bounding": [550, 330, 720, 620]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "③ 模型加载（一般不动）", "bounding": [550, 960, 732.4035034179688, 520]}, {"color": "#4a7a8c", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "④ 条件编码 · 画布尺寸", "bounding": [1290, 330, 560, 960]}, {"color": "#b0483f", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 5, "title": "⑤ 采样（参数已固定）", "bounding": [1890, 330, 360, 826.8991088867188]}, {"color": "#7a4fa0", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 6, "title": "⑥ 输出", "bounding": [2310, 560, 620, 1020]}], "links": [[53, 30, 0, 29, 0, "CLIP"], [54, 33, 0, 29, 1, "STRING"], [56, 29, 0, 31, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [57, 36, 0, 31, 2, "CONDITI